# 🧱 Component Design Rules

- Keep components **small, single-purpose, and composable**.
- Each component folder should include:
  - `index.tsx`
  - `types.ts` (if props are complex)
- Reusable components go in `src/components/common/`.
- Prefer prop-driven design (`<Card title="..." count={12} />`).
- Dashboard widgets should:
  - Show skeletons while loading.
  - Animate entry using Framer Motion.
  - Use `Card`, `Stat`, or `Table` layout conventions.